WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.860
Tranquility Base here. The Eagle has landed.

00:09.940 --> 00:13.960
The most meaningful things were never built alone.

00:14.960 --> 00:20.540
It's always groups of people building and believing until something clicks.

00:21.740 --> 00:24.480
Thinking together is innate to us.

00:24.480 --> 00:31.420
Painted cave walls. Campfire stories. Playing chess even though machines do it better.

00:32.420 --> 00:38.660
Togetherness gives us meaning. About a year ago, we took a hard look at where AI was headed.

00:38.980 --> 00:45.680
The future felt lonely and unsettling. Billion-dollar companies with a solo founder

00:45.680 --> 00:53.780
behind a chat window. No need for teamwork. Humans are friction. We think that gets the future wrong.

00:56.160 --> 01:01.280
Making each person ten times faster doesn't make a company ten times better.

01:01.540 --> 01:04.540
That's a story of efficiency and cost.

01:05.020 --> 01:07.600
AI should be a story of abundance.

01:08.160 --> 01:10.020
More minds on any problem.

01:10.420 --> 01:11.840
More opportunities.

01:12.380 --> 01:14.940
More people doing their life's work.

01:16.020 --> 01:19.480
Notion has always been a tool for people to think together.

01:20.080 --> 01:23.440
Now we're building AI that belongs in that space.

01:24.100 --> 01:31.000
Not behind one person's screen, but inside a team's collective memory, working alongside everyone.

01:31.820 --> 01:39.240
Every team in the world deserves it. Not just the Fortune 500 with dedicated AI teams.

01:39.240 --> 01:45.400
The fintech startup in New York with more ambition than people.

01:45.400 --> 01:51.300
The Australian healthcare experts giving doctors time back. The three founders in Lagos who don't know yet what they're about to become.

01:51.300 --> 01:59.780
The best things in humanity haven't been built yet. They will be built by us together.
